* A register name in an equ's value is a symbol for r68, here an undefined one: Val's uses are
* absolute long references to the external d2 (gas would make Val an alias of the register).
* fixed: 25aacca 2026-10-12 r68togas: a register name in an equ's or set's value is a symbol
* expect text: 4a390000 00004e71
* expect reloc: R_68K_32          d2
Val equ d2
 psect equ_register_name,0,0,0,0,0
 tst.b Val
 nop
 ends
